drive geom CHECK ARGS [--slot NAME] [--screen MON] [--tol PX] [--min PX] [--floor PX] [--axis x|y] [--depth N]

  insets SEL                 content inset (ignores StateLayer, Surface, MouseArea children) on all 4 sides equal within --tol (1)
  overlap SEL                matched nodes, hover growth applied: no overlap, gap >= --min (2)
  inside CHILD PARENT        child rect inside parent; overhang per side <= --tol (0)
  centre A B                 centre offset per axis (or one --axis) <= --tol (1), plus monitor-edge distances
  target SEL                 input area (StateLayer, else node) >= --floor (24) per axis
  dump [SEL]                 listing of nodes with rects, to find selectors (--depth 3)
  rect SEL                   "x y w h" of the first match

SEL = step/step/...  step = Type | *, then [N] (0-based index of the step's matches)
and/or [attr=value] filters; each step searches the descendants of the previous one.
  Rail/RailEntry[2]    Rollout    *[type=Slider]    RailEntry[text=21]
Env: DRIVE_QS_PATH (default ~/Projects/qsm-desktop/shell), GEOM_TREE (read this JSON file instead).
